   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dark glow: median ~49, cool blacks (32,34,40), warm highlights (236,207,190), balanced hue mix with aqua/blue 33%, saturation 0.36. Light glows out of darkness. Best for: Moody forests and waterfalls, storm skies, mist and rain, dark temple/heritage exteriors, cinematic couple frames in weather. Dark look - use on frames with a clear light source.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
